            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 7,
              "start": 7
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Court, the question presented is whether that limitation on second or successive motions makes \u00a7\u202f2255 \u201cinadequate or ineffective\u201d such that the prisoner may proceed with his statutory claim under \u00a7\u202f2241."
      }
    ],
