              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 67,
                "start": 67
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Ms. Ratner, amicus Ratner argues that Congress did not intend the saving clause to create a new remedy for statutory\u2011injustice claims and that treating it as such would be inconsistent with the clause\u2019s historical framing."
